<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - FINA Q2 net profit up slightly.</title>
<headline>TABLE - FINA Q2 net profit up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>    Net per share (dollars)	 1.28	    vs  1.22</p>
<p>    Net profit			 40.02	    vs 38.08</p>
<p>NOTE - U.S. oil firm Fina Inc, a unit of Belgium's PetroFina, said the rise in second quarter net profits and earnings per share reflected stronger refining and marketing margins. These were only partly offset by lower crude oil and natural gas prices, higher exploration costs and weaker margins for chemicals.</p>
</text>
